OL,5,G0335 Cruising with Susan Calman
OL,6,     FSusan takes a dream cruise in
OL,7,     FAustralia, beginning in Melbourne,
OL,8,     Fwhich she explores by tram. She
OL,9,     Falso spots her first-ever kangaroo
OL,10,     Fin the wild and enjoys a
OL,11,     Fwine-tasting excursion.
OL,12,G0425 Warship: Life in the Royal Navy
OL,13,     FJJ Chalmers is put to the ultimate
OL,14,     FMarine training test, and also
OL,15,     Fremotely drives an attack boat.
OL,16,     FJulia visits HMS Belfast to talk
OL,17,     Fto veterans about what naval life
OL,18,     Fwas like during WWII. (Ep3/3)
